This scene bundles the Abyssal Garden engine (https://github.com/Noniv/abyssal-garden),
which is MIT licensed and copyright (c) 2026 Maksymilian Dendura. The engine source is
shared with scenes/abyssal-garden/source/src and is not duplicated here; the build script
patches two hooks into it and appends the game layer in src/game.js.

